5.2 Version 1.1.2 from 2024-12-10
=================================

   • Fix occasional errors like "The connected server(s) does not
     support method ‘$/lean/plainGoal’" by not wrapping invocations of
     ‘lsp-protocol’ macro into ‘eval-when-compile’ but rather into
     ‘eval-and-compile’.  Thus, the methods should now work, no matter
     whether Lean4-Mode was loaded by interpreting ‘.el’ Elisp code or
     by loading compiled ‘.elc’ or ‘.eln’ files.  (Bug#54
     (https://github.com/leanprover-community/lean4-mode/issues/54),
     Zulip discussion
     (https://leanprover.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/468104-Emacs/topic/lsp-mode.20errors.20due.20to.20list.20!.3D.20hash-table))


